    <td colspan="2"><h2><strong>Introduction</strong></h2>
<p>RFID Pentester Tag Pack is a curated collection of the <em>must-have</em> tags when working with RFID tools. The pack has three different tiers, are optimised to most people's use-cases and price ranges. This tag pack has significant discounts over buying cards individually.<br></p>
<p><strong>The pack has three different versions</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<strong>Basic Pack<br></strong>The minimum RFID cards that every pen-tester must have. Includes cards that you will encounter on a daily basis.<br><span style="color: #cc0000;"><strong>Save 20€</strong></span><br><br>
</li>
<li>
<strong>Standard Pack<br></strong>The essential RFID Cards, plus a collection of cards for use in the field by pentesters / red-teamers, including "DirectWrite" cards (Modifiable with an Android device), more advanced cards (One-Time-Write UID Cards, MIFARE DESFire® Compatible EV1 emulators), and the Ultimate Magic Card.<br><span style="color: #cc0000;"><strong>Save 105€</strong></span><br><br>
</li>
<li>
<strong>Complete Pack<br></strong>Every RFID card available on Lab401. Everything in the Basic + Standard Packs, and all our advanced / specialty cards and emulation fobs.<br><span style="color: #cc0000;"><strong>Save 160€</strong></span><br><br>
</li>
</ul>
<p>Please see the individual product pages for more information about each product.</p>
